<title>CHINA: Trading in Kader shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Kader shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of toy maker Kader Holdings Co Ltd was suspended on Friday afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Kader shares ended the morning session HK$0.52, or 37.96 percent, higher at HK$1.89 after hitting a year high of HK$1.90.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
